          "Observability: The ability to understand the internal state of a system by examining its external outputs. Three pillars: (1) Metrics — numerical measurements over time (latency, throughput, error rate). (2) Logs — detailed event records with timestamps and context. (3) Traces — end-to-end request paths through distributed systems. Observability answers WHY something is wrong.",
